      "end_line": 91,
      "content": "These log statements (\"path already in tree\", \"invalid path component\", \"added to existing parent\", \"adding new path\") look like debug logging that will be very verbose in production. Please remove them or gate them behind a debug flag."
    },
    {
      "path": "pkg/remote/fileshare/s3fs/s3fs.go",
      "start_line": 210,
